      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Scheduler Statistics",
      "source_hash": 7690603483379311828,
      "context_hash": 15878813657577767586,
      "translation": "스케줄러 통계",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduler": "스케줄러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:00:50.671395Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "/proc/schedstat, /proc/PID/schedstat, and the sched_statistics structure",
      "source_hash": 2099525143171387986,
      "context_hash": 3464217008025405518,
      "translation": "/proc/schedstat, /proc/PID/schedstat, 그리고 sched_statistics 구조체",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:00:50.671396Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What schedstat tracks",
      "source_hash": 9386896616398714818,
      "context_hash": 8543955160140181950,
      "translation": "schedstat이 추적하는 항목",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:00:50.671396Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel accumulates per-task and per-CPU scheduling statistics under `CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS`.",
      "source_hash": 6980217644773461648,
      "context_hash": 7870724144550008469,
      "translation": "커널은 `CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS` 아래에서 태스크별, CPU별 스케줄링 통계를 누적합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:00:50.671396Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "These tell you how long tasks wait, how long they sleep, how often they migrate, and what's happening in the load balancer.",
      "source_hash": 337691970531822237,
      "context_hash": 2765726822924463257,
      "translation": "이 통계는 태스크가 얼마나 오래 대기하는지, 얼마나 오래 잠들어 있는지, 얼마나 자주 마이그레이션되는지, 그리고 로드 밸런서에서 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지를 알려 줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:00:50.671396Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Schedstat is the first place to look when diagnosing scheduling anomalies: excessive wait times, unexpected migrations, or load imbalance.",
      "source_hash": 9546691789185341962,
      "context_hash": 6264266251671735086,
      "translation": "스케줄링 이상 현상, 즉 과도한 대기 시간, 예기치 않은 마이그레이션, 부하 불균형을 진단할 때 가장 먼저 살펴볼 곳은 schedstat입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:00:50.671397Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Enabling schedstat",
      "source_hash": 17374898604140128948,
      "context_hash": 17445378182441337844,
      "translation": "schedstat 활성화",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:00:50.671397Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Without `CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS`, the fields exist but are always zero.",
      "source_hash": 15902815690172556372,
      "context_hash": 2481282107229653653,
      "translation": "`CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS`가 없으면 필드는 존재하지만 항상 0입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:00:50.671397Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Most production kernels have `CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS` compiled in but disabled by default via the sysctl.",
      "source_hash": 9723126634245635556,
      "context_hash": 12505003372390202816,
      "translation": "대부분의 프로덕션 커널은 `CONFIG_SCHEDSTATS`를 포함하여 컴파일되어 있지만, sysctl을 통해 기본적으로 비활성화되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernels": "커널",
        "sysctl": "sysctl"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:00:50.671397Z",
      "issues": []
    },
