    {
      "id": "section:5/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "A high `nr_involuntary_switches` relative to `nr_voluntary_switches` suggests the task is being preempted frequently — it may be using more CPU than its allocation allows, or competing with higher-priority tasks.",
      "source_hash": 9845537397280038924,
      "context_hash": 6727237510100639292,
      "translation": "`nr_voluntary_switches`에 비해 `nr_involuntary_switches`가 높으면 태스크가 자주 선점되고 있음을 뜻합니다. 할당량보다 많은 CPU를 쓰고 있거나 더 높은 우선순위의 태스크와 경쟁하고 있을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:17:24.434655Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
